Assets of the gw-lensing part.

gw-lensing-data.js: generated by tasks/t08-gw-lensing/S1/make_lensing_data.py (GLoW 0.1,
Villarrubia-Rojo+ 2409.04606, GPL-3.0-or-later; only its numerical output is stored here).
It also holds a trimmed copy (t >= 450 M) of the prod_n24 NR puncture tracks, horizon radii
and h_22 from slides/parts/ringdown/assets/ringdown-data.js (task t04-ringdown).

