  Downloaded 2026-09-27 from
  https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/The_Earth_seen_from_Apollo_17.jpg
  (3000x3002). Wikimedia Commons licence field: Public domain (NASA). Original source:
  NASA GRIN, GPN-2000-001138. Cropped to the Earth's disk (centre and radius from the lit
  pixels), resized to 400x400, transparent outside the disk.
